#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:2
msgid "Networking"
msgstr "网络"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:4
msgid ""
"Networking in libuv is not much different from directly using the BSD "
"socket interface, some things are easier, all are non-blocking, but the "
"concepts stay the same. In addition libuv offers utility functions to "
"abstract the annoying, repetitive and low-level tasks like setting up "
"sockets using the BSD socket structures, DNS lookup, and tweaking various"
" socket parameters."
msgstr ""
"libuv 中的网络编程与直接使用 BSD 套接字接口并没有太大不同，有些事情更容"
"易了，一切都是非阻塞的，但概念保持不变。此外，libuv 还提供了一些实用函数，"
"用来抽象那些烦人、重复且底层的任务，例如使用 BSD 套接字结构体设置套接字、"
"DNS 查询以及调整各种套接字参数。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:10
msgid "The ``uv_tcp_t`` and ``uv_udp_t`` structures are used for network I/O."
msgstr "``uv_tcp_t`` 和 ``uv_udp_t`` 结构体用于网络 I/O。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:14
msgid ""
"The code samples in this chapter exist to show certain libuv APIs. They "
"are not examples of good quality code. They leak memory and don't always "
"close connections properly."
msgstr ""
"本章中的代码示例只是为了展示某些 libuv API。它们并不是高质量代码的范例。"
"它们会泄漏内存，而且不总是能正确关闭连接。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:19
msgid "TCP"
msgstr "TCP"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:21
msgid ""
"TCP is a connection oriented, stream protocol and is therefore based on "
"the libuv streams infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"TCP 是一种面向连接的流协议，因此建立在 libuv 流基础设施之上。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:25
msgid "Server"
msgstr "服务器"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:27
msgid "Server sockets proceed by:"
msgstr "服务器套接字按以下步骤进行："

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:29
msgid "``uv_tcp_init`` the TCP handle."
msgstr "用 ``uv_tcp_init`` 初始化 TCP 句柄。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:30
msgid "``uv_tcp_bind`` it."
msgstr "用 ``uv_tcp_bind`` 绑定它。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:31
msgid ""
"Call ``uv_listen`` on the handle to have a callback invoked whenever a "
"new connection is established by a client."
msgstr ""
"在该句柄上调用 ``uv_listen``，每当有客户端建立新连接时，就会有一个回调被调"
"用。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:33
msgid "Use ``uv_accept`` to accept the connection."
msgstr "使用 ``uv_accept`` 接受连接。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:34
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`stream operations <buffers-and-streams>` to communicate with "
"the client."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`stream operations <buffers-and-streams>` 与客户端通信。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:37
msgid "Here is a simple echo server"
msgstr "下面是一个简单的回显服务器"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:39
msgid "tcp-echo-server/main.c - The listen socket"
msgstr "tcp-echo-server/main.c - 监听套接字"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:46
msgid ""
"You can see the utility function ``uv_ip4_addr`` being used to convert "
"from a human readable IP address, port pair to the sockaddr_in structure "
"required by the BSD socket APIs. The reverse can be obtained using "
"``uv_ip4_name``."
msgstr ""
"可以看到，实用函数 ``uv_ip4_addr`` 用于把人类可读的 IP 地址与端口组成的二"
"元组转换为 BSD 套接字 API 所需的 sockaddr_in 结构体。反向转换可以通过"
" ``uv_ip4_name`` 得到。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:52
msgid "There are ``uv_ip6_*`` analogues for the ip4 functions."
msgstr "这些 ip4 函数都有对应的 ``uv_ip6_*`` 类似函数。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:54
msgid ""
"Most of the setup functions are synchronous since they are CPU-bound. "
"``uv_listen`` is where we return to libuv's callback style. The second "
"arguments is the backlog queue -- the maximum length of queued "
"connections."
msgstr ""
"大多数设置函数都是同步的，因为它们是 CPU 密集型的。``uv_listen`` 是我们回"
"归 libuv 回调风格的地方。第二个参数是 backlog 队列——即已排队连接的最大长"
"度。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:58
msgid ""
"When a connection is initiated by clients, the callback is required to "
"set up a handle for the client socket and associate the handle using "
"``uv_accept``. In this case we also establish interest in reading from "
"this stream."
msgstr ""
"当客户端发起连接时，回调必须为客户端套接字设置一个句柄，并使用"
" ``uv_accept`` 关联该句柄。在本例中，我们还声明了希望从这个流读取数据。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:62
msgid "tcp-echo-server/main.c - Accepting the client"
msgstr "tcp-echo-server/main.c - 接受客户端"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:69
msgid ""
"The remaining set of functions is very similar to the streams example and"
" can be found in the code. Just remember to call ``uv_close`` when the "
"socket isn't required. This can be done even in the ``uv_listen`` "
"callback if you are not interested in accepting the connection."
msgstr ""
"其余的函数与流示例非常相似，可以在代码中找到。只需记住，在不再需要套接字"
"时调用 ``uv_close``。如果你不打算接受连接，甚至可以在 ``uv_listen`` 回调"
"中这么做。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:75
msgid "Client"
msgstr "客户端"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:77
msgid ""
"Where you do bind/listen/accept on the server, on the client side it's "
"simply a matter of calling ``uv_tcp_connect``. The same ``uv_connect_cb``"
" style callback of ``uv_listen`` is used by ``uv_tcp_connect``. Try::"
msgstr ""
"在服务器端要做的是 bind/listen/accept，而在客户端只需调用 ``uv_tcp_connect``"
" 就可以了。``uv_connect_cb`` 风格的回调与 ``uv_listen`` 的相同，也由"
" ``uv_tcp_connect`` 使用。试试看："

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:91
msgid ""
"where ``on_connect`` will be called after the connection is established. "
"The callback receives the ``uv_connect_t`` struct, which has a member "
"``.handle`` pointing to the socket."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``on_connect`` 会在连接建立之后被调用。回调会接收 ``uv_connect_t`` 结"
"构体，其中有一个指向套接字的成员 ``.handle``。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:96
msgid "UDP"
msgstr "UDP"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:98
msgid ""
"The `User Datagram Protocol`_ offers connectionless, unreliable network "
"communication. Hence libuv doesn't offer a stream. Instead libuv provides"
" non-blocking UDP support via the `uv_udp_t` handle (for receiving) and "
"`uv_udp_send_t` request (for sending) and related functions. That said, "
"the actual API for reading/writing is very similar to normal stream "
"reads. To look at how UDP can be used, the example shows the first stage "
"of obtaining an IP address from a `DHCP`_ server -- DHCP Discover."
msgstr ""
"`User Datagram Protocol`_ 提供的是无连接、不可靠的网络通信。因此 libuv 并"
"不提供流。取而代之，libuv 通过 `uv_udp_t` 句柄（用于接收）和"
" `uv_udp_send_t` 请求（用于发送）以及相关函数来提供非阻塞的 UDP 支持。话虽"
"如此，实际的读写 API 与普通的流读取非常相似。为了看看 UDP 能怎么用，本示"
"例展示了从 `DHCP`_ 服务器获取 IP 地址的第一个阶段——DHCP Discover。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:108
msgid ""
"You will have to run `udp-dhcp` as **root** since it uses well known port"
" numbers below 1024."
msgstr ""
"你必须以 **root** 身份运行 `udp-dhcp`，因为它使用了 1024 以下的知名端口"
"号。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:111
msgid "udp-dhcp/main.c - Setup and send UDP packets"
msgstr "udp-dhcp/main.c - 设置并发送 UDP 数据包"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:120
msgid ""
"The IP address ``0.0.0.0`` is used to bind to all interfaces. The IP "
"address ``255.255.255.255`` is a broadcast address meaning that packets "
"will be sent to all interfaces on the subnet.  port ``0`` means that the "
"OS randomly assigns a port."
msgstr ""
"IP 地址 ``0.0.0.0`` 用于绑定到所有接口。IP 地址 ``255.255.255.255`` 是广"
"播地址，这意味着数据包会被发送到子网中的所有接口。端口 ``0`` 表示由操作系"
"统随机分配一个端口。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:125
msgid ""
"First we setup the receiving socket to bind on all interfaces on port 68 "
"(DHCP client) and start a read on it. This will read back responses from "
"any DHCP server that replies. We use the UV_UDP_REUSEADDR flag to play "
"nice with any other system DHCP clients that are running on this computer"
" on the same port. Then we setup a similar send socket and use "
"``uv_udp_send`` to send a *broadcast message* on port 67 (DHCP server)."
msgstr ""
"首先，我们把接收套接字设置为绑定到所有接口的 68 端口（DHCP 客户端），并在"
"其上启动一次读取。这样就能读回任何作出回应的 DHCP 服务器的响应。我们使用"
" UV_UDP_REUSEADDR 标志，以便与此计算机上运行在同一端口的其他系统 DHCP 客户"
"端和平共处。然后我们设置一个类似的发送套接字，并使用 ``uv_udp_send`` 在 67"
" 端口（DHCP 服务器）上发送一条 *广播消息*。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:132
msgid ""
"It is **necessary** to set the broadcast flag, otherwise you will get an "
"``EACCES`` error [#]_. The exact message being sent is not relevant to "
"this book and you can study the code if you are interested. As usual the "
"read and write callbacks will receive a status code of < 0 if something "
"went wrong."
msgstr ""
"**必须** 设置广播标志，否则你会得到一个 ``EACCES`` 错误 [#]_。实际发送的消"
"息内容与本书无关，如果你感兴趣，可以研究一下代码。和往常一样，如果出了问"
"题，读回调与写回调会收到一个 < 0 的状态码。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:137
msgid ""
"Since UDP sockets are not connected to a particular peer, the read "
"callback receives an extra parameter about the sender of the packet."
msgstr ""
"由于 UDP 套接字并不连接到特定的对端，读回调会收到一个额外的参数，说明数据"
"包的发送方。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:140
msgid ""
"``nread`` may be zero if there is no more data to be read. If ``addr`` is"
" NULL, it indicates there is nothing to read (the callback shouldn't do "
"anything), if not NULL, it indicates that an empty datagram was received "
"from the host at ``addr``. The ``flags`` parameter may be "
"``UV_UDP_PARTIAL`` if the buffer provided by your allocator was not large"
" enough to hold the data. *In this case the OS will discard the data that"
" could not fit* (That's UDP for you!)."
msgstr ""
"如果没有更多数据可读，``nread`` 可能为零。如果 ``addr`` 为 NULL，表示没有"
"内容可读（此时回调不应做任何事情）；如果不为 NULL，表示从 ``addr`` 处的主"
"机收到了一个空数据报。如果你的分配器提供的缓冲区不足以容纳数据，``flags``"
" 参数可能为 ``UV_UDP_PARTIAL``。*在这种情况下，操作系统会丢弃装不下的数据*"
" （UDP 就是这样的！）。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:147
msgid "udp-dhcp/main.c - Reading packets"
msgstr "udp-dhcp/main.c - 读取数据包"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:155
msgid "UDP Options"
msgstr "UDP 选项"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:158
msgid "Time-to-live"
msgstr "生存时间"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:160
msgid ""
"The TTL of packets sent on the socket can be changed using "
"``uv_udp_set_ttl``."
msgstr ""
"套接字上所发送数据包的 TTL 可以用 ``uv_udp_set_ttl`` 更改。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:163
msgid "IPv6 stack only"
msgstr "仅 IPv6 协议栈"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:165
msgid ""
"IPv6 sockets can be used for both IPv4 and IPv6 communication. If you "
"want to restrict the socket to IPv6 only, pass the ``UV_UDP_IPV6ONLY`` "
"flag to ``uv_udp_bind``."
msgstr ""
"IPv6 套接字既可用于 IPv4 通信，也可用于 IPv6 通信。如果你想把套接字限制为"
"仅 IPv6，请把 ``UV_UDP_IPV6ONLY`` 标志传给 ``uv_udp_bind``。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:170
msgid "Multicast"
msgstr "组播"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:172
msgid "A socket can (un)subscribe to a multicast group using:"
msgstr "套接字可以通过以下方式（取消）订阅组播组："

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:178
msgid "where ``membership`` is ``UV_JOIN_GROUP`` or ``UV_LEAVE_GROUP``."
msgstr "其中 ``membership`` 为 ``UV_JOIN_GROUP`` 或 ``UV_LEAVE_GROUP``。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:180
msgid "The concepts of multicasting are nicely explained in `this guide`_."
msgstr "`this guide`_ 对组播的概念作了很好的讲解。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:184
msgid ""
"Local loopback of multicast packets is enabled by default [#]_, use "
"``uv_udp_set_multicast_loop`` to switch it off."
msgstr ""
"组播数据包的本地环回默认是启用的 [#]_，可以使用"
" ``uv_udp_set_multicast_loop`` 将其关闭。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:187
msgid ""
"The packet time-to-live for multicast packets can be changed using "
"``uv_udp_set_multicast_ttl``."
msgstr ""
"组播数据包的生存时间可以用 ``uv_udp_set_multicast_ttl`` 更改。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:191
msgid "Querying DNS"
msgstr "查询 DNS"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:193
msgid ""
"libuv provides asynchronous DNS resolution. For this it provides its own "
"``getaddrinfo`` replacement [#]_. In the callback you can perform normal "
"socket operations on the retrieved addresses. Let's connect to "
"Libera.chat to see an example of DNS resolution."
msgstr ""
"libuv 提供异步 DNS 解析。为此，它提供了自己的 ``getaddrinfo`` 替代实现"
" [#]_。在回调中，你可以对获取到的地址执行正常的套接字操作。让我们连接到"
" Libera.chat，看一个 DNS 解析的示例。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:198 ../../src/guide/networking.rst:215
msgid "dns/main.c"
msgstr "dns/main.c"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:205
msgid ""
"If ``uv_getaddrinfo`` returns non-zero, something went wrong in the setup"
" and your callback won't be invoked at all. All arguments can be freed "
"immediately after ``uv_getaddrinfo`` returns. The `hostname`, `servname` "
"and `hints` structures are documented in `the getaddrinfo man page "
"<getaddrinfo_>`_. The callback can be ``NULL`` in which case the function"
" will run synchronously."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``uv_getaddrinfo`` 返回非零值，说明设置过程出了问题，你的回调根本不"
"会被调用。所有参数都可以在 ``uv_getaddrinfo`` 返回之后立即释放。"
"`hostname`、`servname` 和 `hints` 结构体在 `the getaddrinfo man page"
" <getaddrinfo_>`_ 中有说明。回调可以为 ``NULL``，此时函数将同步运行。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:211
msgid ""
"In the resolver callback, you can pick any IP from the linked list of "
"``struct addrinfo(s)``. This also demonstrates ``uv_tcp_connect``. It is "
"necessary to call ``uv_freeaddrinfo`` in the callback."
msgstr ""
"在解析器回调中，你可以从 ``struct addrinfo(s)`` 链表中任选一个 IP。这里也"
"演示了 ``uv_tcp_connect`` 的用法。必须在回调中调用 ``uv_freeaddrinfo``。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:222
msgid "libuv also provides the inverse `uv_getnameinfo`_."
msgstr "libuv 还提供了其反向版本 `uv_getnameinfo`_。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:227
msgid "Network interfaces"
msgstr "网络接口"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:229
msgid ""
"Information about the system's network interfaces can be obtained through"
" libuv using ``uv_interface_addresses``. This simple program just prints "
"out all the interface details so you get an idea of the fields that are "
"available. This is useful to allow your service to bind to IP addresses "
"when it starts."
msgstr ""
"通过 libuv 使用 ``uv_interface_addresses`` 可以获取系统网络接口的信息。这"
"个简单的程序只是打印出所有接口的细节，让你了解有哪些可用字段。这有助于让"
"你的服务在启动时绑定到 IP 地址。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:234
msgid "interfaces/main.c"
msgstr "interfaces/main.c"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:240
msgid ""
"``is_internal`` is true for loopback interfaces. Note that if a physical "
"interface has multiple IPv4/IPv6 addresses, the name will be reported "
"multiple times, with each address being reported once."
msgstr ""
"对于环回接口，``is_internal`` 为 true。注意，如果一个物理接口拥有多个"
" IPv4/IPv6 地址，其名称将被报告多次，每个地址报告一次。"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:252
msgid "https://beej.us/guide/bgnet/html/#broadcast-packetshello-world"
msgstr "https://beej.us/guide/bgnet/html/#broadcast-packetshello-world"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:253
msgid "https://tldp.org/HOWTO/Multicast-HOWTO-6.html#ss6.1"
msgstr "https://tldp.org/HOWTO/Multicast-HOWTO-6.html#ss6.1"

#: ../../src/guide/networking.rst:254
msgid ""
"libuv use the system ``getaddrinfo`` in the libuv threadpool. libuv "
"v0.8.0 and earlier also included c-ares_ as an alternative, but this has "
"been removed in v0.9.0."
msgstr ""
"libuv 在 libuv 线程池中使用系统的 ``getaddrinfo``。libuv v0.8.0 及更早版本"
"还包含 c-ares_ 作为替代方案，但这在 v0.9.0 中已被移除。"

